<title>USA: RDO Equipment overallotment exercised.</title>
<headline>RDO Equipment overallotment exercised.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>RDO Equipment Co said Wednesday in connection with its initial public offering underwriters exercised a 630,000-share overallotment of its common stock.</p>
<p>C.S. First Boston was the lead underwriter in RDO's IPO.</p>
<p>RDO owns and operates a network of John Deere industrial dealerships and agricultural dealerships. It also sells, rents and services agricultural equipment.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
